  "description": "Clean Architecture template — Infrastructure.Persistence.SqlServer leaf package: SQL Server EF Core provider, SqlServer Dapper provider (connection factory + SQL dialect + EF↔Dapper unwrapper), ScriptDom-based WITH (NOLOCK) rewriter, SQL Server health check, SU2 SQL Server bulk engine (UseSqlServerBulkInsert: bulk insert plus the opt-in bulk write/match/temp-table capabilities), and SqlClient OpenTelemetry instrumentation. Opt-in — reference only when the service uses SQL Server, so the base package stays provider-free. Numeronym `C15e` = CleanArchitecture. Generation 2026 series. See docs/adr/persistence-provider-level-split-analysis.md.",
  "id": "SU2.C15e.Infrastructure.Persistence.SqlServer",
